# Build context for Model-Development/Dockerfile: the component folder minus its tests,
# caches and anything a run writes. BuildKit uses this file in place of any root
# .dockerignore, so the Airflow image's context is unaffected.
*
!Model-Development
Model-Development/tests
# What a run writes (gitignored): never part of the image. The workflow mounts these
# folders from artifacts/ (ADR-032).
Model-Development/runs
Model-Development/reports
# MLflow's stores (#104): run data from local use, never part of the image
Model-Development/mlflow
Model-Development/mlruns
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
# The Google auth step's credentials file in the workspace root (ADR-035): already outside
# !Model-Development, named here so loosening the allowlist cannot let it into an image.
gha-creds-*.json
**/gha-creds-*.json
